# Jac build/state junk. `.jac/` matches at any depth, so it covers both the repo-root
# .jac/data/ session db and jac/.jac/cache/. It does NOT touch jac/*.jac source files.
.jac/

# Raw downloads are fetched, not committed (~400 MB MarineCadastre pull). data/*.py is
# the replay layer and IS committed; extracted per-pack AIS windows
# (scenarios/*/ais_window.csv, ~1 MB) are committed too so the demo runs offline.
# NOTE: earlier revisions of this file ignored data/ and geo/ wholesale, which would
# have silently dropped data/*.py and geo/*.geojson on the next `git add -A` -- do not
# reintroduce a bare `data/` or `geo/` line here.
/data/raw/
/geo/
